           spec.containers{hotel-reserv-rate}: Started container hotel-reserv-rate\n  Warning  BackOff    4s (x4 over 73s)    kubelet            spec.containers{hotel-reserv-rate}: Back-off restarting failed container hotel-reserv-rate in pod rate-6fff88f6f5-zr48x_hotel-reservation(59e7d617-8261-4f3e-aa20-2b7af633a94c)\n', id='4ed8b896-d5b4-44b2-b2f8-c1b40c90bf8f', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-b1d52a45ab44a370'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='3e561a9e-c0a9-44f3-9b5e-0d202b35fafb')]]
