-03-17T16:07:02Z"\n    message: ReplicaSet "mongodb-rate-bfbcf4587" has successfully progressed.\n    reason: NewReplicaSetAvailable\n    status: "True"\n    type: Progressing\n  - lastTransitionTime: "2026-03-17T16:08:44Z"\n    lastUpdateTime: "2026-03-17T16:08:44Z"\n    message: Deployment has minimum availability.\n    reason: MinimumReplicasAvailable\n    status: "True"\n    type: Available\n  observedGeneration: 1\n  readyReplicas: 1\n  replicas: 1\n  updatedReplicas: 1\n', id='04cf4b74-da62-440f-a0e8-e181c1672a5e', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-84da73db0c6f34fa'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='8f57bfda-0815-4cef-a633-0204a018cd31')]]
